\tag{fdip}
\title{The determinant and the diagonal bound}
\date{2026-11-21}

\p{An invertible diagonal rescaling has the same characteristic
polynomial as the original matrix. When the rescaled matrix is
symmetric, what determinant and diagonal bound does it have,
and which functions on the double cosets meet a positive
eigenvector?}

